        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, we have built a comprehensive platform designed specifically to meet the unique integrated workflow needs of service SMBs.",
        "start_character": 5428,
        "end_character": 5563
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As the number of service SMBs grow, as we develop or acquire complementary solutions, and as we enter new geographies, our market opportunity will expand.",
        "start_character": 15960,
        "end_character": 16114
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we become more embedded in our customers’ daily business operations, we are better positioned to add value by cross-selling and up-selling adjacent solutions.",
        "start_character": 26426,
        "end_character": 26587
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we continue to develop, acquire and transform our solutions, we aim to continue adding value to our customers by displacing point-solution competitors and legacy, manual methods with our integrated digital offerings, increasing our ARPU and improving customer experience and retention.",
        "start_character": 26588,
        "end_character": 26876
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By improving the awareness of our brands and solutions, we believe that we can increase penetration and sell our complete value chain of solutions to service SMB customers.",
        "start_character": 25927,
        "end_character": 26099
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our solutions, many of which we believe are market leaders in their industries, are deployed in verticals that are comprised of numerous micro-verticals, which through product development and new solution acquisition, offer natural growth opportunities for EverCommerce.",
        "start_character": 19587,
        "end_character": 19857
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer select solutions to customers in other services verticals, including education, non-profit, pet care and automotive repair, among many others.",
        "start_character": 22318,
        "end_character": 22469
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide tailored, integrated Software-as-a-Service (“SaaS”) solutions that support the highly diverse workflows and customer interactions that professionals in home services, health services, and wellness services need to automate manual processes, generate new business, and create more loyal customers.",
        "start_character": 135,
        "end_character": 442
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Within each suite, our Business Management Software – the system of action at the center of a service business’ operation –is typically the first solution adopted by a customer.",
        "start_character": 6335,
        "end_character": 6512
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "These laws are enforced by federal, state and local regulatory agencies in the jurisdictions where we operate, and in some instances also through private civil litigation.",
        "start_character": 41741,
        "end_character": 41912
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We aggressively manage and measure our identification, selection, retention, growth and development of our current and future employees.",
        "start_character": 34716,
        "end_character": 34852
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001853145-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001853145-26-000010-f7c5b2d03120db20",
        "accession_number": "0001853145-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe in and prioritize inclusivity and employee engagement in our workplace and aim to behave in a manner where these values are the underpinnings of how we build programs and support the growth and development of our people.",
        "start_character": 34484,
        "end_character": 34715
      }
    ]
